{"title":"Chicken","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chicken\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/chicken?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>256</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chicken?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>10,648</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/chicken\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>256</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/chicken?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>10,648</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"chicken\" data-map-level=\"0\">Show level 0 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-ex